[00:00.28] Unakkul naane urugum iravil
[00:04.78] Ullathai naan sollavaa?
[00:36.13] Unakkul naane urugum iravil
[00:40.66] Ullathai naan sollavaa?
[00:45.17] Marugum manathin ragasiya araiyil
[00:49.54] Othigai paarthidavaa?
[00:54.04] Siruga siruga unnil ennai
[00:58.59] Tholaitha mozhi sollavaa?
[01:02.96] Sollaa sollum ennai vaattum
[01:07.57] Ranamum thenallavaa?
[01:11.73] Minnum pani saaral
[01:13.73] Un nenjil serndhaale
[01:16.18] Kannil unnai vaiththu
[01:18.20] Pen thaiththuk kondaale
[01:20.71] Vennilaa thoovi
[01:22.67] Than kaadhal sonnaale
[01:25.20] Malligai vaasam
[01:27.14] Un pechchil kandaale
[01:30.52] Pon maan ival aa?
[01:34.98] Un vaanavillaa?
[01:39.48] Pon maan ival aa?
[01:43.99] Un vaanavillaa?
[01:56.63] Oram-oram-oram-poraa!